promptfoo-rs

promptfoo-rs is an independent Rust reimplementation that targets selected
promptfoo-compatible local workflows and configuration formats. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the upstream promptfoo project.

The name "promptfoo" is used in this repository to describe compatibility
targets, command surfaces, configuration files, fixtures, and release-gate
evidence.

